          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, apparently, they found out that the messenger RNA carries 19 amino acids with it, back and forth,",
      "start": 2448.17,
      "end": 2455.09,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 2448.17,
