          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, this is the most kind and benign country in the world. They...",
      "start": 2905.31,
      "end": 2907.85,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 2905.31,
          "end": 2905.33,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
